{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagindar is an online PvP Arena game that you can enjoy with your friends for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no predefined classes or heroes. In each match, you create your own class and play exactly how you want with complete freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will you build your dynamic class and outsmart your opponents? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE YOUR CLASS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556690/extras/0dd8f0b5f671f690757c52103ab804f7.poster.avif?t=1768563964\" width=568 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556690/extras/0dd8f0b5f671f690757c52103ab804f7.webm?t=1768563964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556690/extras/0dd8f0b5f671f690757c52103ab804f7.mp4?t=1768563964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every match, you design your own unique class by selecting abilities and items from an extensive list that aligns perfectly with your style of play.<br>Join the battle in Imagindar and unleash your imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC MATCHES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556690/extras/8a0dbb368f81bfb56984c826831df5df.poster.avif?t=1768563964\" width=568 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556690/extras/8a0dbb368f81bfb56984c826831df5df.webm?t=1768563964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556690/extras/8a0dbb368f81bfb56984c826831df5df.mp4?t=1768563964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in thrilling battles where tactics and cunning are key to outsmarting your opponents.<br>Create your own maps and host unique servers. Dive into the action now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556690/extras/ca7e3b44a16c736b9e8bd36fa9d7ef87.poster.avif?t=1768563964\" width=568 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556690/extras/ca7e3b44a16c736b9e8bd36fa9d7ef87.webm?t=1768563964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556690/extras/ca7e3b44a16c736b9e8bd36fa9d7ef87.mp4?t=1768563964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own class</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 100 abilities and 25 items to craft your own class each match, customizing it to perfectly align with your unique playstyle.<strong>    </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of engaging game modes, each offering a unique and exciting gameplay experience. Choose the mode that suits your preferences and immerse yourself in thrilling challenges.<strong>    </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 9 captivating maps that await your strategic conquest, or unleash your creativity with our in-game map editor and craft your own unique battlegrounds.<strong>    </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bots</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your skills and test new strategies by battling against AI-controlled bots.    <br>Perfect your gameplay before taking on real opponents.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Chat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with your teammates and coordinate your tactics using in-game voice and text chat.    <br>Stay connected and strategize effectively to secure victory.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replays</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive your most epic moments and analyze your gameplay with the replay feature.    <br>Study your strategies, improve your skills, and showcase your best plays.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streaming Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly integrate with Twitch and engage with your audience and build a community around your gaming adventures.<strong>  </strong>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low Minimum Requirements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game on a wide range of PCs, including older systems.    <br>Experience smooth gameplay and immerse yourself in the action, regardless of your hardware, through a detailed option menu.   </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2556690?t=1768563964","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2556690?t=1768563964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556690/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768563964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556690/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768563964","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"In-App 